    {
      "sessionId": "787ba795-b866-4e4d-9eb9-71176962863e",
      "seq": 206,
      "actor": "ai:dm",
      "type": "narration",
      "payload": {
        "text": "The fourth goblin claws in again, Snag's order barked over the firelight, and its grip closes on leather and nothing else \u2014 Tamsin twists her arm free before it can set, boots skidding in the churned mud. Snag's pole rattles, the stolen silver chain flashing at his wrist. \"Hold! Hold, stupid dog!\" he shrills, grin curdling toward annoyance. The lookout still clamps her legs, blood soaking its fur dark, and the pot-helm goblin loads another stone. Pell strains forward against his bindings, spear-rag snapping in the smoke, eyes locked on his sister's face.\n\nWhat does Tamsin do?\n\nGoblin by the fire \u2014 Goblin-4 lunges again for Tamsin's sword arm, trying to drag her toward the post per Snag's no-bleeding order.: 1d20-1 \u2192 15 = 14 vs DC 15: failure",
        "actionIds": []
      },
